Inclusion Criteria:

1. Patients with pathologically confirmed metastatic pancreatic cancer;
2. Patients who have not received any prior systemic anti-tumor therapy, or who have undergone prior radical pancreatic cancer surgery and received regular postoperative adjuvant chemotherapy, and who have developed recurrence or metastasis more than 6 months after final adjuvant chemotherapy;
