16. Persons with severe mental disorders;
17. Women who may be pregnant, gestating, or breastfeeding;
18. Subjects of childbearing age who are unwilling to use contraception during the trial period up to 3 months after the last dose;
19. Participation in a clinical trial of another drug or medical device within 4 weeks prior to the trial;
