14. Receive any immunoglobulin or blood product within 3 months prior to the first injection, or plan to receive such product from Day 0 to Month 7 (30 days after receiving the third dose of vaccination);
15. 3 days before vaccination, suffering from acute illness or acute exacerbation of chronic disease; using fever reducer, Antihistamines, and Analgesics(such as: Acetaminophen, Ibuprofen, Aspirin, loratadine, Cetirizine, etc. )
